{
  "name": "Flash-Jour - Flux C (Mass Video Sales)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://developers.cjdropshipping.com/api2.0/v1/product/list",
        "authentication": "headerAuth",
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "CJ-Access-Token",
              "value": "VOTRE_TOKEN"
            }
          ]
        },
        "bodyParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "pageNum",
              "value": "1"
            },
            {
              "name": "pageSize",
              "value": "10"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "1",
      "name": "Get Trending Products",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.1,
      "position": [0, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Tu es un expert en e-commerce viral.\n\nPRODUIT : {{$node[\"Get Trending Products\"].json[\"productName\"]}}\nPRIX : {{$node[\"Get Trending Products\"].json[\"productPrice\"]}}\n\nTACHE :\n1. Rédige un script de voix off de 15 secondes ultra-dynamique.\n2. Inclus un fort appel à l'action.\n3. Rédige les hashtags TikTok.\n\nRETOURNE CE JSON :\n{\n  \"script\": \"...\",\n  \"hashtags\": \"#...\"\n}"
      },
      "id": "2",
      "name": "Sales Script IA",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.basicLlmChain",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [250, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": "claude-3-5-sonnet-20240620"
      },
      "id": "3",
      "name": "Claude AI",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.anthropicChatModel",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [250, 500]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "text": "={{JSON.parse($input.item.json.text).script}}",
        "voice": "alloy"
      },
      "id": "4",
      "name": "OpenAI TTS",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.openAi",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [500, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "title": "=Alerte Produit : {{$node[\"Get Trending Products\"].json[\"productName\"]}}",
        "videoBinaryPropertyName": "data",
        "description": "={{JSON.parse($node[\"Sales Script IA\"].json[\"text\"]).hashtags}}"
      },
      "id": "5",
      "name": "YouTube Shorts",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.youtube",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [750, 300]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Get Trending Products": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Sales Script IA",
